 r←Test_HTTP_007(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕TRAP;request;res;headers
⍝ Send the very same request twice: `SendAndReceive` must not change the caller's request.
⍝ Tatin (x-tatin, test-request) as well as Rumba (connection) used to append headers to it with every call,
⍝ so a re-used request carried them again and again.
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 r←T._Failed

 request←R.NewRequest 0
 request.Headers,←⊂'Accept' 'application/json'
 request.RequestTarget←'/v1/packages/exist/aplteam-APLProcess-0.2.0'
 headers←request.Headers

 res←TC.SendAndReceive ∆LocalHostAndPort request
 →T.PassesIf 200=res.StatusCode
 res←TC.SendAndReceive ∆LocalHostAndPort request
 →T.PassesIf 200=res.StatusCode

 →T.PassesIf headers≡request.Headers

 r←T._OK
⍝Done
